<title>UK: Graystone year pretax profit up 47 pct.</title>
<headline>Graystone year pretax profit up 47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.5		    vs 1.45</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 0.64		   vs 0.52</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    9.33		   vs 6.58</p>
<p> Turnover		   92.06		  vs 46.97</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering and distribution group Graystone Plc said increased efficiencies plus benefits from new products and expanding export markets had contributed to &quot;the substantial increase in the performance of the group&quot;.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 10.54		  vs 6.58</p>
<p> Discontinued ops	 0.096 loss	   vs 0.352</p>
<p> Interest payable	 1.39		   vs 0.67</p>
<p> Tax			  2.71		   vs 1.52</p>
<p> Net taxed		  6.62		   vs 4.85</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 17</p>
<p> Div registration date  November 19</p>
<p> Ex-div date		November 11</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
